These were the private '''quarters''' of [[Padawan]] [[Barriss Offee]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="To Catch a Jedi" /> Offee kept a statue of a [[Unidentified Mirialan deity|Mirialan deity]] on an altar within her room.<ref name="A Jedi's Duty">{{StoryCite|story=A Jedi's Duty|book=Stories of Jedi and Sith}}</ref>

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Barriss Offee's quarters, designed by [[David Le Merrer]], are marked by the same black diamond pattern facial marks as Offee's face.<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/the-wrong-jedi-trivia-gallery|text="The Wrong Jedi" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 6}}</ref>

